# Exact operator image for the currently composable checkpoint-resident graph.
#
# The newer prepared router and native MXFP8 FFN-input packer remain available
# in the production source, but are intentionally absent here: their optimized
# all-MX consumer does not yet support routed/layer-indexed weight selection or
# a contiguous batch-one hidden output.  This manifest therefore keeps the
# existing layer-loop-compatible router and routed checkpoint FFN so an E2E
# number never relies on an implicit hidden conversion.
# Build contract: num_insts=576 dynamic_smem_kb=210.
OP_DSV4_ATTENTION_SPLIT64_UMMA_SM100
OP_DSV4_ATTENTION_SPLIT_REDUCE_FP8_SM100
OP_DSV4_PRELOAD_ROPE_TABLES
OP_DSV4_FP32_BF16_GEMV
OP_DSV4_HC_PRE_RMS
OP_DSV4_ZERO_FILL
OP_DSV4_FP8_QUANT_128
OP_FP8_BLOCK128_GEMV_SM100
OP_DSV4_RMS_FP8_QUANT_UMMA_B_SM100
OP_DSV4_RMS_ROPE_512_64
OP_DSV4_ROPE_64
OP_DSV4_HC_POST
OP_DSV4_BF16_GEMV
OP_DSV4_BF16_GEMV_GROUP4_SPLITK_SM100
OP_DSV4_NVFP4_QUANT_UMMA_B_SM100
OP_NVFP4_GEMV_UMMA_STREAM_SM100
OP_NVFP4_GEMV_UMMA_FP32_SM100
OP_LOOPC
OP_DSV4_GATED_POOL_PACKED8_SHARD128
OP_DSV4_GATED_POOL_PACKED8_HISTORY_STATE
OP_DSV4_GATED_POOL_TAIL_RMS_PARTIAL
OP_DSV4_GATED_POOL_RMS_ROPE
OP_DSV4_FP32_RMS_ROPE_SHARD128
OP_ARGMAX_SMEM_PARTIAL_BF16
OP_TERMINATEC
OP_DSV4_ROUTE_TOP6
OP_DSV4_HC_HEAD_RMS
OP_ARGMAX_SMEM_REDUCE_BF16
OP_DSV4_FP8_QUANT_UMMA_B_SM100__SCALE_PACK_2
OP_FP8_GEMV_UMMA_COUPLED_SM100
